Package: rapidsvy
Type: Package
Title: Rapid Design-Based Estimation for Complex Surveys
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Ahmad Watsiq", "Maula", email = "ahmad.watsiq.m@mail.ugm.ac.id", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Taylor linearisation variance estimation for stratified cluster
    samples, computed for every domain in a single multithreaded pass in C++.
    Results match the 'survey' package (svymean, svytotal, svyratio,
    svyquantile, svyciprop, svychisq, svyglm) for one-stage
    with-replacement designs, through a 'dplyr' style interface similar to
    'srvyr'.
License: GPL (>= 2)
URL: https://github.com/wmaula/rapidsvy
BugReports: https://github.com/wmaula/rapidsvy/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    Rcpp,
    rlang,
    vctrs,
    tibble,
    dplyr,
    tidyselect,
    generics,
    stats,
    parallel
LinkingTo: Rcpp
Suggests:
    survey,
    srvyr,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    bench,
    haven
SystemRequirements: C++17
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
